	(text "A/B LINK NETWORK (D-054).\nPath A, default: BYP1+BYP2 fitted, AD620 socket empty - ADS1220 PGA reads the bridge directly.\nPath B: pull BYP1+BYP2, fit BYP3+BYP4 and the AD620 - two-stage chain, as Wirikuta had it.\nNever fit all four: that shorts the amplifier output to the bridge."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
